ils>`:''}${e.evidence?.length?`<details><summary>Field-level official evidence</summary><ul>${e.evidence.map(v=>`<li><strong>${E(v.field)}</strong>: ${E(v.text)} ${external(v.url,'Source for this field')}</li>`).join('')}</ul></details>`:''}<p class="meta">Checked ${E(e.checked)}. Unverified fields are explicitly marked; this is not an admissions prediction.</p><div class="actions">${e.sources.map((s,i)=>external(typeof s==='string'?s:s.url,typeof s==='string'?'Official source '+(i+1):s.label)).join('')}</div></article>`;
